id: pure-form-controlled-chaos
name: Controlled Chaos
order: 4
slot: mastery
mastery: 2
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (2) "Ignore the 2nd effect of Erratic Majin".
keepsOnCondition: absorption-awakening
description: >
  You capitalize on your chaotic nature, turning it into your greatest weapon.
text: >
  Controlled Chaos (2): You capitalize on your chaotic nature, turning it into your greatest weapon.
  (1)-[Permanent]: You cannot master Pure Form for the 3rd time unless your base Tier of Power is 4+.
  (2)-[Passive]: Ignore the 2nd effect of Erratic Majin.
  (3)-[Passive]: Ignore the 2nd effect of the Superior State.
  (4)-[Triggered]: If you use the Transformation Maneuver to enter an Evolved Stage of Pure Form while in the Pure Form Transformation, you may ignore the 1st effect of Erratic Majin.
  (5)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Roll your Chaos Die.

---

# (1) Its third Mastery only at base Tier of Power 4+: Mastery is the table's to give. (2) Erratic Majin (2) ignored: its header.

# (3) The Superior State's 2nd effect ignored.
[passive, effect 3]
allow superior.noExtraDamage;

# (4) Into an Evolved Stage of it: Erratic Majin (1) ignored.
[passive, effect 4]
allow chaos.keepOnEvolved;

# (5) With the Power Up, once a Round: the Chaos Die rolled again.
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 5]
chaosDie();
